  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/aturpin0504/AaTurpin.PSSnapshotManager",
  "published": "2025-07-06T18:44:48.79Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial release with comprehensive network share snapshot capabilities. Features include: file system snapshot capture with pre-compiled exclusion pattern support for optimal performance, snapshot comparison engine for detecting added/modified/deleted files, BITS-based file copying from network shares to staging areas, BITS-based file moving from staging areas back to network shares with collision handling, comprehensive logging and error tracking, batch processing for large file sets, and integration with AaTurpin.PSConfig for configuration management.",
